# Portfolio Website Content Brief

## Site Overview

**Purpose:** Cold call credibility and portfolio showcase. When a prospect Googles Paul after a call, this site confirms he is legit and shows proof of work. All content is written to the business owner, not to other service providers.

**Positioning:** Marketing and operations for home service businesses. Matches LinkedIn profile exactly.

**Tone:** Conversational, direct, short sentences. Sounds like Paul talking to a business owner on a cold call. Every section leads with the business owner's problem. The solution follows naturally. Never reads like a service menu.

