### Service 1: Social Media

**Headline:**
Your customers are checking your Instagram before they call you.

**Body copy:**

When a homeowner needs a roofer, they Google your company. They check your reviews. Then they look at your Instagram or Facebook page. If your last post was three months ago or your page looks dead, they move on to the next guy.

You do great work. The before and after photos alone would get attention. But you are on a roof all day and posting never happens.

I handle it. I plan the content, create the graphics, edit the videos, schedule the posts, and send you a report every month so you know what is working. You do the work. I make sure people see it.

**What this covers:**
Content strategy, graphic design, short-form video editing, scheduling and posting, profile optimization, monthly performance reports.

---

### Service 2: Websites

**Headline:**
What does your website look like on a phone right now?

**Body copy:**

Go ahead and pull it up. Does it load fast? Does it look clean? Can a customer find your phone number in 3 seconds? Can they see your work?

If the answer is no, you are losing jobs to businesses with a better website. Not because they do better work. Because they look more trustworthy online.

I build clean, fast websites that show your work and make it easy for customers to contact you. No templates that look like everyone else. Built for your business, works on every device, loads fast even on a job site with bad signal.

**What this covers:**
Custom website design and development, mobile-friendly, fast loading, contact forms, service pages, project gallery, Google-ready.

---

### Service 3: Operations and Systems

**Headline:**
How much time do you spend catching up after work every day?

**Body copy:**

You get home at 5pm and then the real work starts. Returning calls you missed during the day. Following up on estimates that went out last week. Figuring out which jobs are scheduled for tomorrow. Texting your crew about changes.

If your process lives in text messages, memory, and sticky notes, things are going to slip. Estimates go cold. Callbacks pile up. Customers stop waiting and call someone else.

I build simple systems that keep everything organized. Trackers, workflows, SOPs, and automations so you spend less time catching up and more time on jobs that make you money.

**What this covers:**
SOP creation, workflow design, task tracking systems, CRM setup and automation (GoHighLevel, HubSpot, Notion), process documentation, follow-up systems.

---

### Service 4: Custom Tools

**Headline:**
What if the tool your business needs does not exist yet?

**Body copy:**

You have tried the software. Monday, Asana, Trello, whatever someone told you to use. It is either too complicated, too expensive, or does not fit how your business actually works. So you stopped using it and went back to doing everything manually.

I build custom tools that fit your business. Not someone else's template. Yours. Client portals where customers approve work with a swipe. Dashboards that show you everything in one place. Automated reports that used to take hours to put together.

I built a client portal from scratch that replaced Monday.com for a team that hated using it. It is live and running right now.

